OL,4,BNo trust problem with Ferrari team -   
OL,5,BHamilton                               
OL,6,GLewis Hamilton says there is           
OL,7,G"definitely not" a trust problem       
OL,8,Gbetween him and his Ferrari team.      
OL,10,FThe seven-time champion has twice in   
OL,11,Fthe past four races ignored a call to  
OL,12,Fpit for fresh tyres, both times to his 
OL,13,Fcompetitive disadvantage.              
OL,15,FThe most recent time, in the Sao Paulo 
OL,16,FGrand Prix on 8 November, Hamilton     
OL,17,Fstayed out on worn slick tyres in      
OL,18,Fworsening rain and ended up spinning   
OL,19,Fbefore pitting on the next lap.        
